-- whether any of a material's own symmetries is improper. A molecule is achiral exactly when an improper
-- operation is among its symmetries, and the smallest such operation is a mirror plane acting as the
-- identity on the atoms.
any-improper-b : List BMotion → Bool
any-improper-b qs = case qs of
  nil → false
  cons q r → (case bm-proper q of true → any-improper-b r; false → true)
